      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "These covenants include limits on the disposal of assets and the amount of debt secured by liens we may incur.",
      "char_start": 59678,
      "char_end": 59788,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          60324,
