      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "As of May 31, 2026, we were in full compliance with each of these covenants, and we believe it is unlikely we will fail to meet any of these covenants in the foreseeable future.",
      "char_start": 60047,
      "char_end": 60224,
      "raw_spans": [
