      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "As of and for the fiscal years ended May 31, 2026 and 2025, we did not have any borrowings outstanding under our $3 billion program.",
