      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "On July 17, 2025, we filed a shelf registration statement (the \"Shelf\") with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (the \"SEC\") which permits us to issue an unlimited amount of debt securities from time to time.",
