      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "On March 6, 2026, we entered into a 364-day committed credit facility agreement with a syndicate of banks, which provides for up to $1 billion of borrowings, with an option to increase borrowings up to $1.5 billion in total with lender approval.",
